Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.80,H_id,,0,0,0,,Si pewaris kehilangan segalanya... kini dia berlutut memohon
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:30.80,C_id,,0,0,0,,Tonton semua episode GRATIS ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:00.94,S_id,,0,0,0,,Sudah, jangan ditekan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.54,0:00:03.50,S_id,,0,0,0,,Seluruh lantai 28 milik Shen Xiujin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.02,0:00:05.38,S_id,,0,0,0,,Tanpa kartu kamu tak bisa naik.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.78,0:00:10.68,S_id,,0,0,0,,Jian Tong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.12,S_id,,0,0,0,,Nona Jian.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:15.85,S_id,,0,0,0,,Hari ini kamu benar-benar membuka mataku.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:17.13,S_id,,0,0,0,,Dahulu Nona Jian yang angkuh,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.69,0:00:18.81,S_id,,0,0,0,,kini demi meminta belas kasihan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.25,S_id,,0,0,0,,merendahkan diri di depan umum
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.29,0:00:22.33,S_id,,0,0,0,,memeluk seorang pelayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.69,0:00:24.19,S_id,,0,0,0,,Katakan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.89,0:00:26.93,S_id,,0,0,0,,kalau si tua Jian Zhendong tahu,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.87,0:00:29.23,S_id,,0,0,0,,apakah dia malu setengah mati?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:30.78,S_id,,0,0,0,,Keluarga Jian tidak punya Jian Tong.
